BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Samurai and the Prisoner
DTSTART:20260827T224500Z
DTEND:20260828T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260827T224500Z
UID:UTvTrX7tkh
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 147 mins (2h27m)\n\nDuring the Azuchi era\, Araki Mu
 rashige\, a samurai who served Oda Nobunaga\, eventually rebelled against 
 his lord and barricaded himself within Arioka Castle. As the siege wore on
 \, a bafflingly brutal murder occurred inside the castle walls. With no on
 e able to solve the crime\, fears and tensions are rising\, Murashige turn
 ed to a man he himself had cast into a dungeon: Kuroda Kanbei. Regarded as
  one of the greatest military strategists of the Sengoku period\, he began
  providing Murashige with clues to solve the mystery.\n\nhttps://www.siff.
 net/cinema/in-theaters/the-samurai-and-the-prisoner\n\nEstimated start: 16
 :00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Invite
DTSTART:20260828T021500Z
DTEND:20260828T042000Z
DTSTAMP:20260828T021500Z
UID:gEGIojgdrD
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nJoe and Angela’s marriage is o
 n thin ice. When they invite their enigmatic upstairs neighbors for a dinn
 er party\, the night spirals into unexpected places. Have they reignited t
 he spark or lit the match that burns it all down?\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/
 cinema/in-theaters/the-invite\n\nEstimated start: 19:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:American Doctor
DTSTART:20260830T200000Z
DTEND:20260830T215000Z
DTSTAMP:20260830T200000Z
UID:Up8vGRiMhl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 93 mins (1h33m)\n\nThree courageous doctors—a Jewi
 sh orthopedic surgeon from North Carolina\, a Zoroastrian trauma surgeon f
 rom California\, and a Palestinian American ER specialist from Illinois—
 volunteer their services in Gaza\, risking their lives to save others.\n\n
 https://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/american-doctor\n\nEstimated start
 : 13:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
